      "content": "thanks for the advice. i also noticed that the person who usually handles my payroll is suddenly on \"vacation\" and my manager has been avoiding eye contact in the halls. it just feels like they're closing ranks to isolate me. given that these things are happening all at once, how can i prove to a lawyer that this isn't just a coincidence but an actual coordinated effort?",
